### parity summary ###
web source: web/src/components/forms/VehicleSelect.tsx (+ useSelectedVehicle.ts + store/selectedVehicle.tsx).
data binding (P1/S8, no HTTP in the view): VehicleSelectSource over SelectedVehicleStore (selection) +
  VehiclesStore.vehicles() (fleet feed) — the same shared holders every vehicle-scoped screen follows.
states reproduced (every one renders — no hidden surface): loading (select-shaped skeleton) / content (the
  Material 3 Select dropdown, options = display_name || vin || "Vehicle {id}", optional leading car icon) /
  empty (friendly NoVehicleSelected — web returns null because the host page shows it; a self-contained
  surface shows it itself) / hard error (QueryError + Retry) / stale (stale chip + one auto-refresh) /
  offline (cached fleet kept selectable + offline chip) / refreshing (updating chip).
a11y: merged TalkBack trigger label "Select vehicle, {active}" on the dropdown; loading row labelled;
  EmptyState/QueryError carry their own descriptions. i18n: every string via stringResource over existing
  P1/S10 catalog keys (en/ar/he). diagnostics: one-shot PII-safe view.opened {surface=VehicleSelect} via the
  redacting logger — never a vehicle id or VIN; select/refresh also log surface-slug-only events.
